t, the USA easily won Group B, going undefeated.  The Unified Team finished second in Group A, losing to Cuba.  The semi-finals saw the USA play the former Soviet team, and stunningly, the Unified Team won, 79-73.  The Unifieds then defeated China in the final to win the gold medal, with the United States defeating Cuba for the bronze medal."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button764765", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button764765').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Scoring Average"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Time Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Disqualifications"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals Made"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals %"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals Made"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals %"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals %", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG%"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Free Throws", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FT"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Free Throws %"] [:th